<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Food Price Index rises 0.1 pct in April.</title>
<headline>NZ Food Price Index rises 0.1 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Tuesday released the following data for the Food Price Index for April:</p>
<p>    Apr 1997	    Mar 1997		Apr 1996</p>
<p>    +0.1 pct	    +1.1 pct		+0.3 pct</p>
<p>yr-end Apr 1997  yr-end Mar 1997  yr-end Apr 1996</p>
<p>    +3.4 pct	    +3.6 pct		+0.5 pct</p>
<p>Note - The index makes up 18 percent of the consumer price index (CPI).</p>
<p>Food subgroups, percentage change from the same month of the previous year:  </p>
<p>				    Apr 1997	Apr 1996</p>
<p>    Fruit and Vegetables    +13.9 pct     -10.4 pct</p>
<p>    Meat, fish and poultry  +2.2 pct	-2.9 pct</p>
<p>    Grocery food etc	  +1.8 pct	+4.3 pct</p>
<p>    Restaurants		 +1.7 pct	+2.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
